/*
Pokemon Multiverse - hand-authored boss teams (merged by trainer_gen.py).
Only Items / AI (and party) are taken from here; Name, Class, Pic, Gender,
Music and Double Battle stay as in vanilla. Missing moves are filled with
mdb.best_moveset (TM allowed); moves a species cannot learn at that level are
auto-replaced and reported. IVs default to 31 for Leader / Elite Four /
Champion / Steven / Wally (Victory Road), otherwise level-scaled + 6.
*/

